{"id": "60220", "title": "恋人未满", "author": "白夜十", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 10, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/60/60220.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／校园生活／年上攻／正剧\r\n\r\n关键字：习铮 　任玦珩 　双性生子 \r\n\r\n文案：\r\n\r\n习铮这辈子没遇过甚麽无法解决的棘手问题\r\n\r\n就算他母亲是个酒鬼，换男人无数\r\n\r\n就算他暗恋著这样的母亲17年\r\n\r\n直到某一天，她对他说：\r\n\r\n小铮，我要结婚了......", "base": "files/article/html/60/60220", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "8827904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "8827906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-16", "file": "8827908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17-21", "file": "8827910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-24", "file": "8827912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-28", "file": "8827914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-34", "file": "8827915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "35-38", "file": "8827916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "39-43", "file": "8827918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-45", "file": "8827921.html", "available": false}]}